# Use Case Quick Reference

When implementing a feature, find the UC code and follow its Database Impact exactly.

| UC Code | Feature | Key Constraint |
|---------|---------|---------------|
| UC-1.1 | Google Sign-In | Any Google account may sign in. Create `users` doc on first login with `isHumgVerified: false`. Host features require UC-1.3. |
| UC-1.2 | Logout | Clear Firebase Auth session. |
| UC-1.3 | HUMG Email Verify (OTP) | Client generates 6-digit OTP → SHA-256 hash → store in `otpRequests/{uid}` (ttl 10 min, max 3 attempts). Send plain-text email via Gmail SMTP (`mailer` pkg). On success: **Batch Write** `users.isHumgVerified=true` + `users.humgEmail` + delete `otpRequests/{uid}`. Route guard redirects unverified users to `/verify-humg` (except `/` feed). |
| UC-2.1 | Generate Deep Link | URL format: `askme-humg-app.web.app/user/{userId}`. Export shareable card image. |
| UC-2.2 | View Profile | Show: name, avatar, answer count, total likes. Show `VerifiedBadge` (badgeCheck icon) next to name when `isHumgVerified == true`. |
| UC-3.1 | Submit Anonymous Question | 300 char max. Rate limit server-side (HTTP API / Cloud Function per SRS). Request verification per deployment (App Check target). |
| UC-3.2 | Manage Inbox | Query `questions` where `toUserId == currentUser.uid`. Two tabs: unanswered / answered. |
| UC-3.3 | Answer & Publish | **Batch Write** `answers` (new doc) + `questions` (set `status: 'answered'`). Denormalize `hostName`, `hostAvatar`, `hostIsHumgVerified` from `users` into `answers` doc. |
| UC-4.1 | View Feed | `isPublished == true`, default `orderBy createdAt desc`, optional **Trending** via `orderBy hotScore desc` (denormalized score). Cursor pagination, limit 20. Optional topic filter (`aiCategory` / `aiTagIds`). Show `VerifiedBadge` when `hostIsHumgVerified == true`. |
| UC-4.2 | Like/Unlike | **Transaction**: update `likedBy` + `likeCount` (kept equal to `likedBy.length`) + `hotScore` when `createdAt` exists. **Requires `isHumgVerified == true`** — unverified users see `verifyRequiredToLike` snackbar. |
| UC-4.3 | Comment | **Transaction**: `comments` (new doc) + `answers` (`commentCount` + `hotScore`). Denormalize `authorName`, `authorAvatar`, `authorIsHumgVerified` from `users` into `comments` doc. Show `VerifiedBadge` next to commenter name when `authorIsHumgVerified == true`. **Requires `isHumgVerified == true`** — unverified users see `verifyRequiredToComment` snackbar. |
| UC-5.1 | Report Content | Create `reports` doc with `status: 'pending'`. |
| UC-5.2 | Admin Moderate | Update `reports.status` + delete or set `isPublished: false` on content. |

## Implementation Checklist for Any Feature
- [ ] Reference the UC code in your implementation
- [ ] Use Batch Write wherever UC says "Batch Write"
- [ ] Use Riverpod `AsyncNotifier` for the feature's state
- [ ] Handle loading, error, and success states in the UI
- [ ] Add input validation (client-side) before any Firebase call
- [ ] Add proper error handling – never swallow exceptions silently
